- [ ] `cargo jackioh gate` prints, per matchup, the same counts as on base `576009234`: ai-vs-random 19/20 (17 needed), ai-vs-greedy 17/20 (10), hard-vs-easy 15/20 (16), not won `gate:v3:hard-vs-easy:` 2, 5, 7, 13, 18, 0 search panics, no fallback. Report the gate as **failed** with those numbers, and say that base fails it identically (the planner ran both in a scratch copy). Do not tune anything to make it pass.
